{
    "type": "Collection",
    "id": "ASAC_116_1",
    "stac_version": "1.1.0",
    "description": "Thirty-nine species (31 Monogononta and 8 Bdelloidea) are described from Macquarie Island.  Thirty-eight of these are new records for the island. Included in the data are the distribution of rotifers at Macquarie Island, in fresh water and Brackish and a comparative measurement of Keratella sancta from New Zealand, Iles Kerguelen and Macquarie Island.\n\nThe fields in this dataset include:\npH\nLocation\nRotifers\nDistribution: Present or Not found\nIles Kerguelen\nMacquarie Island\nNew Zealand\nLorica Length\nLorica width\nLength of spines",
